* Explicit HC adc_bridge vs original implicit HC input
Vext ext 0 PWL(0 5 8n 5 9n 2.15 29n 2.15 30n 0 40n 0 41n 5 50n 5)
Rext ext pin 1k
Aadc pin d_in CUSTOM_ADC
.model CUSTOM_ADC adc_bridge(in_low=2.1 in_high=2.2 rise_delay=1p fall_delay=1p time_tol=10p out_low=0 out_high=5 clamp_low=0 clamp_high=5 clamp_res=10 clamp_bias=.5 out_family="HC")
Aalb [d_in] [q] MD
.model MD d_logic_block file=logic family="HC" input_load=2p out_res=40 out_delay=2n
.file logic
PORT DIN in[0] ;
PORT Q out[0] ;
Q = DIN ;
.endf
Rout q 0 100k
.tran 20p 50n 0 20p
.PRINT TRAN V(ext) V(pin) V(q)
.end